WEBVTT

00:00:01.270 --> 00:00:04.410
This is the Champions Carnival, the Japanese lightweight title match.

00:00:04.410 --> 00:00:08.570
What kind of outcome will await us at the end of this momentous battle?

00:00:09.550 --> 00:00:13.030
Facing the champion, Imae Katsutaka, is the challenger, Aoki Masaru!

00:00:14.110 --> 00:00:17.530
We’re now one minute into the round, and they are still staring each other down!

00:00:17.960 --> 00:00:20.080
The match is literally at a standstill!

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:24.040
<i>Now  </i>there’s <i>a stance. And it’s intimidating to boot.</i>

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:25.990
<i>I can’t find an opening.</i>

00:00:25.990 --> 00:00:29.480
<i>So where should I attack? The right? The left?</i>

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:36.310
<i>That stance is right outta the textbook.</i>

00:00:36.310 --> 00:00:39.180
<i>If I can’t go left or right, then the middle it is!</i>

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:41.560
The challenger rushes straight ahead!

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:44.310
<i>He couldn’t stand the tension anymore?</i>

00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:46.270
<i>Made you look!</i>

00:00:46.620 --> 00:00:49.730
Wait, he circles around! What a mavericky move!

00:00:49.730 --> 00:00:50.980
That's our Aoki-san!

00:00:50.980 --> 00:00:52.480
Yeah, get him!

00:00:52.480 --> 00:00:54.990
<i>Gotcha! Here’s the opening hit!</i>

00:00:56.220 --> 00:00:57.280
A left!

00:00:57.720 --> 00:01:01.120
It’s like the champion saw that move coming all along!

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:02.040
<i>Dammit!</i>

00:01:02.740 --> 00:01:06.540
The champion’s lefts are on the mark! They put a real hurting on the challenger!

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:16.060
And a right!

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:18.050
That blow came at just the right distance!

00:01:18.390 --> 00:01:19.550
Masaru!

00:01:21.440 --> 00:01:23.680
<i>I really felt that right.</i>

00:01:24.040 --> 00:01:26.480
Good, he still has his footing.

00:01:26.480 --> 00:01:28.720
He’s now throwing huge punches.

00:01:28.720 --> 00:01:30.910
He’s about to get into his rhythm!

00:01:30.910 --> 00:01:33.570
That’s the champion for you. He knows how to pace himself.

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:36.190
He’s not going to KO him here.

00:01:36.190 --> 00:01:38.470
He’ll continue pounding him up until the later stage.

00:01:39.070 --> 00:01:43.080
Aoki! You need to shift the currents, or else you’ll be sucked into the undertow!

00:01:43.990 --> 00:01:46.830
Those pinpoint lefts are the champion’s lifeline.

00:01:46.830 --> 00:01:49.040
Will the challenger be able to counter them?

00:01:52.590 --> 00:01:55.150
<i>Thanks to that heavy blow, now I know!</i>

00:01:55.150 --> 00:01:56.590
<i>After you throw those small lefts...</i>

00:01:57.260 --> 00:01:57.840
<i>you come with a right!</i>

00:02:00.010 --> 00:02:01.930
Whoa! He’s in position to...

00:02:08.430 --> 00:02:10.330
Frog Punch!

00:02:17.780 --> 00:02:19.870
Frog Punch!

00:02:20.410 --> 00:02:23.500
But no! The Frog barely misses him!

00:02:24.540 --> 00:02:25.750
God! I thought he had him!

00:02:25.750 --> 00:02:28.640
If he can avoid <i>that</i>  move, he has nothing left!

00:02:28.640 --> 00:02:30.460
The move everyone came to see was a dud!

00:02:30.810 --> 00:02:34.750
But the Frog did leave a huge claw mark on the champion’s cheek!

00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:36.860
You can see how much his face stiffened!

00:02:36.860 --> 00:02:39.420
<i>His entire body weight rode on that uppercut.</i>

00:02:39.420 --> 00:02:41.520
<i>That punch wasn’t merely for show.</i>

00:02:41.520 --> 00:02:45.060
<i>If he had connected, he might have snapped my neck bone!</i>

00:02:45.060 --> 00:02:46.540
He’s afraid!

00:02:46.540 --> 00:02:47.220
Go get him!

00:02:47.220 --> 00:02:48.960
Listen to that excitement over a missed punch!

00:02:48.030 --> 00:02:49.880
{overlap}Frog him some more!

00:02:48.960 --> 00:02:52.360
He certainly is the star of this match! He’s making the fans go wild from the get-go!

00:02:52.810 --> 00:02:54.870
<i>He freaking dodged it.</i>

00:02:54.870 --> 00:02:57.240
<i>He’s definitely done his homework.</i>

00:02:57.750 --> 00:03:01.960
<i>My signature move ain’t gonna take him down that easy.</i>

00:03:01.960 --> 00:03:05.750
<i>So I might as well make him fight on  </i>my <i>terms!</i>

00:03:06.470 --> 00:03:08.750
Whoa! The challenger closes in!

00:03:13.410 --> 00:03:16.140
He’s confusing the champion with his oddball moves!

00:03:18.850 --> 00:03:19.600
<i>Which one?</i>

00:03:20.650 --> 00:03:21.600
<i>Both?</i>

00:03:26.730 --> 00:03:28.320
<i>Now he’s down below?</i>

00:03:28.320 --> 00:03:29.810
<i>He’s nearly touching the ground!</i>

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:31.070
<i>How am I supposed to hit him?!</i>

00:03:33.750 --> 00:03:37.030
<i>He’s below me, but his punches come from above!</i>

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:44.080
<i>Cool it! Don’t fight on his terms!</i>

00:03:45.060 --> 00:03:49.210
The champion throws his textbook-perfect lefts, but he’s clearly being toyed with!

00:03:49.630 --> 00:03:52.710
You can’t find this brand of boxing in any textbook!

00:03:54.020 --> 00:03:56.220
<i>Damn it! I can’t connect!</i>

00:03:56.220 --> 00:03:57.150
Yeah, Aoki!

00:03:57.150 --> 00:03:58.610
You got the champion harried!

00:03:58.610 --> 00:04:00.110
Give us more oddball moves!

00:04:00.110 --> 00:04:01.630
Let’s go, Aoki!

00:04:01.630 --> 00:04:04.790
<i>Even though he missed, that Frog Punch left a huge mark.</i>

00:04:04.790 --> 00:04:07.350
<i>He managed to reverse the flow that was running against him.</i>

00:04:07.780 --> 00:04:09.610
Imae, quit trying to shadow him!

00:04:09.610 --> 00:04:11.320
Step away and control your breathing!

00:04:11.940 --> 00:04:15.650
The champion is now shying away from the fistfight and stepping back!

00:04:16.440 --> 00:04:18.450
<i>I’m not giving you any breathers!</i>

00:04:19.040 --> 00:04:22.450
My goodness! There are no words to describe these moves!

00:04:22.840 --> 00:04:26.460
The challenger is definitely creating his own peculiar rhythm.

00:04:26.460 --> 00:04:27.720
<i>Calm down.</i>

00:04:27.720 --> 00:04:31.090
<i>We’re still boxing, despite all the random moves he’s making.</i>

00:04:31.090 --> 00:04:32.210
<i>We still have rules!</i>

00:04:36.760 --> 00:04:38.180
<i>Now!</i>

00:04:38.180 --> 00:04:41.180
<i>Yes! You finally took the bait, Imae!</i>

00:04:41.180 --> 00:04:44.120
Oh! The champion whiffs his one-two punch!

00:04:44.120 --> 00:04:46.560
The challenger crouches below!

00:04:46.940 --> 00:04:48.870
<i>Hell yeah!</i>

00:05:05.050 --> 00:05:05.870
<i>Yes!</i>

00:05:06.210 --> 00:05:08.290
I-It’s a counter!

00:05:08.290 --> 00:05:10.870
The Frog has been completely squashed!

00:05:11.310 --> 00:05:15.670
The champion has flattened the Frog, just as he promised!

00:05:16.310 --> 00:05:18.310
G-Gosh.

00:05:18.310 --> 00:05:22.580
Aoki-san’s timing couldn’t have been more perfect. But he got taken down by a counter!

00:05:22.580 --> 00:05:25.220
Imae wasn’t using his head at all.

00:05:25.220 --> 00:05:28.680
He beat that counter into his body so that he could do it on reflex!

00:05:29.260 --> 00:05:32.940
<i>That Frog Punch gave you no chance to think.</i>

00:05:32.940 --> 00:05:36.440
<i>But the hours of practice you put in have paid off, Imae!</i>

00:05:36.750 --> 00:05:38.600
<i>You even knocked him down.</i>

00:05:38.600 --> 00:05:42.090
<i>Even if he gets up, you still took away his signature move!</i>

00:05:42.090 --> 00:05:45.450
<i>You’ve now regained the momentum in this match.</i>

00:05:46.730 --> 00:05:49.200
The challenger is still on the mat!

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:51.920
And what a powerful knockdown it was! Can he get up?!

00:05:51.920 --> 00:05:52.460
Masaru!

00:05:52.460 --> 00:05:53.670
Wait, Tomiko!

00:05:54.190 --> 00:05:55.550
Takamura-san.

00:05:55.550 --> 00:05:57.300
Don’t run to him just yet.

00:06:01.810 --> 00:06:04.050
And he’s up!

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:06.340
Can he continue?

00:06:06.340 --> 00:06:08.570
He’s stretching to see if he’s all in one piece.

00:06:09.350 --> 00:06:11.080
He’s really composed.

00:06:11.080 --> 00:06:13.720
That’s because he’s used to being knocked down.

00:06:13.720 --> 00:06:14.660
Still...

00:06:15.960 --> 00:06:18.460
His Frog Punch was ineffective.

00:06:18.460 --> 00:06:22.990
It’s a huge blow knowing your signature move won’t work.

00:06:23.760 --> 00:06:25.280
There’s his fighting pose!

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:26.450
He’s ready to rumble!

00:06:26.840 --> 00:06:30.940
<i>It wasn’t a coincidence when he dodged my first Frog!</i>

00:06:30.940 --> 00:06:33.960
<i>That son of a bitch studied my Frog inside and out!</i>

00:06:34.460 --> 00:06:36.220
<i>He has a strong glint in his eyes.</i>

00:06:36.220 --> 00:06:38.250
<i>So he still has some fight left in him?</i>

00:06:38.950 --> 00:06:41.680
This is his big chance in this rollercoaster first round!

00:06:41.680 --> 00:06:43.800
But the champion doesn’t take it!

00:06:43.800 --> 00:06:47.260
He’s as cool as a cucumber as he inches closer to the challenger!

00:06:48.190 --> 00:06:51.680
That’s why people call Imae a consummate professional.

00:06:51.680 --> 00:06:53.960
Even knocking someone down doesn’t excite him.

00:06:53.960 --> 00:06:55.600
He goes at his own pace.

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:58.480
So he won’t KO him in the first round?

00:06:59.170 --> 00:07:02.400
As long as Imae doesn’t feel the need to do it.

00:07:06.070 --> 00:07:08.250
<i>He’s not as light on his feet as before.</i>

00:07:08.250 --> 00:07:10.330
<i>But did that really hit him where it hurts?</i>

00:07:11.270 --> 00:07:13.170
Now he’s within reach!

00:07:13.170 --> 00:07:16.700
Will we see a KO in the first round? Things are getting tense!

00:07:18.480 --> 00:07:20.550
<i>Thirty seconds left?</i>

00:07:27.670 --> 00:07:28.990
He’s down!

00:07:28.990 --> 00:07:32.350
The challenger gets taken down in a flash!

00:07:32.350 --> 00:07:33.910
You’re kidding me!

00:07:33.910 --> 00:07:35.500
That was a light jab!

00:07:35.500 --> 00:07:37.480
He only lost his balance!

00:07:37.480 --> 00:07:39.400
But look at him!

00:07:40.490 --> 00:07:41.640
He’s really hurting!

00:07:41.640 --> 00:07:45.160
He managed to get upright, but both his hips and feet are wobbly!

00:07:45.160 --> 00:07:48.370
But he still takes up a fighting pose, so the match is still on!

00:07:49.070 --> 00:07:52.310
<i>That Frog counter really took a lot out of him!</i>

00:07:52.310 --> 00:07:54.660
<i>Now any punch can take him down!</i>

00:07:54.660 --> 00:07:55.620
<i>I can do it!</i>

00:07:56.400 --> 00:07:58.430
The champion throws punch after punch!

00:07:58.430 --> 00:07:59.500
He’s betting it all on this rush!

00:07:59.850 --> 00:08:03.010
If he takes him down a third time, that’s the match!

00:08:03.010 --> 00:08:06.510
The challenger puts up a guard, desperately trying to avoid a 1st-round KO!

00:08:06.510 --> 00:08:10.720
But the deluge of lefts and rights keep coming!

00:08:10.720 --> 00:08:12.710
<i>Go down! Go down!</i>

00:08:12.710 --> 00:08:13.600
<i>Go down!</i>

00:08:17.100 --> 00:08:20.020
That’s the end of the first round!

00:08:20.020 --> 00:08:22.940
The challenger is barely saved by the bell!

00:08:22.940 --> 00:08:25.690
However, although he didn’t get a 1st-round KO,

00:08:25.690 --> 00:08:30.280
the champion still proved his prowess by knocking him down twice!

00:08:32.540 --> 00:08:34.330
The match is still young, right?

00:08:34.330 --> 00:08:36.000
<i>He’s probably done for.</i>

00:08:36.370 --> 00:08:38.280
You've got the momentum! You can do it!

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:41.590
Yes, my punches were effective. It won’t be long.

00:08:42.100 --> 00:08:44.330
Don’t give him a chance to recover!

00:08:44.330 --> 00:08:45.880
You keep hitting him, you hear me?!

00:08:46.430 --> 00:08:47.610
Of course.

00:08:47.610 --> 00:08:49.590
This time I will knock him out.

00:08:53.110 --> 00:08:54.410
You okay, Aoki?

00:08:54.410 --> 00:08:55.390
You able to keep going?

00:08:56.210 --> 00:08:57.630
I’m not through.

00:09:01.420 --> 00:09:02.680
Round two!

00:09:50.490 --> 00:09:52.040
He can’t take anymore!

00:09:52.040 --> 00:09:53.380
Something's off.

00:09:53.380 --> 00:09:54.590
Really?

00:09:54.590 --> 00:09:58.360
He’s getting punched left and right, but none of them are clean hits.

00:09:59.870 --> 00:10:03.380
Yeah, I can see the desperation on Imae’s face.

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:08.460
He doesn’t look good. It’s like <i>he’s</i>  on the receiving end.

00:10:09.270 --> 00:10:11.970
Something's definitely off with this match.

00:10:13.070 --> 00:10:14.530
That’s the bell!

00:10:14.530 --> 00:10:17.470
The challenger is once again saved by the bell!

00:10:18.060 --> 00:10:20.670
<i>Damn it! I almost had him!</i>

00:10:20.670 --> 00:10:22.560
<i>Will I have to KO him in the next round?</i>

00:10:27.670 --> 00:10:29.660
<i>Why is he so light on his feet?</i>

00:10:30.220 --> 00:10:32.200
<i>Wasn’t he supposed to be groggy?</i>

00:10:33.280 --> 00:10:35.280
<i>I thought he was barely even able to stand!</i>

00:10:37.420 --> 00:10:38.700
<i>What’s with that look?</i>

00:10:39.360 --> 00:10:41.320
<i>It’s like he’s checking me out.</i>

00:10:44.010 --> 00:10:46.500
<i>Is he checking to see how worn out I am?!</i>

00:10:47.240 --> 00:10:48.640
<i>Damn you!</i>

00:10:48.640 --> 00:10:50.880
<i>So everything that happened up until now...</i>

00:10:51.940 --> 00:10:53.030
<i>was a lie?!</i>

00:10:58.990 --> 00:11:01.610
That strategy really blew us out of the water.

00:11:01.610 --> 00:11:03.420
That down was just an act?

00:11:03.420 --> 00:11:05.020
I don’t believe it!

00:11:06.300 --> 00:11:10.350
<i>I’m too tired to use my footwork.</i>

00:11:10.350 --> 00:11:12.070
<i>The only thing left for me...</i>

00:11:12.850 --> 00:11:14.260
<i>is a slugfest!</i>

00:11:14.260 --> 00:11:17.570
<i>I fell for his trap hook, line, and sinker!</i>

00:11:17.570 --> 00:11:20.450
I see it, but I still don’t believe it.

00:11:20.450 --> 00:11:22.600
You veterans scare me sometimes.

00:11:22.600 --> 00:11:23.800
You dumb jerk!

00:11:23.800 --> 00:11:26.430
I’ve boxed just as long as he has, yet I’ve never hit on that idea!

00:11:26.430 --> 00:11:30.740
Aoki’s the only boxer in the world
 who’d pull a stunt like that!

00:11:30.740 --> 00:11:33.040
So Aoki-san can pull it off just because of who he is?

00:11:33.040 --> 00:11:36.760
I’m really, <i>really</i>  glad he’s on our side.

00:11:37.450 --> 00:11:38.680
Round five!

00:11:40.010 --> 00:11:42.190
<i>Fine! You want a slugfest, you got it!</i>

00:11:42.190 --> 00:11:43.270
<i>Let’s punch it out!</i>

00:11:43.860 --> 00:11:47.670
Whoa! What a clean jab, followed by some nimble footwork!

00:11:47.670 --> 00:11:49.980
It’s now the challenger who makes use of his legs!

00:11:50.310 --> 00:11:51.710
<i>I-Impossible!</i>

00:11:51.710 --> 00:11:53.290
<i>He won’t come and hit me?</i>

00:11:53.290 --> 00:11:54.360
<i>What’s going on here?!</i>

00:11:54.670 --> 00:11:58.060
<i>His feet are really stuck in the bog now.</i>

00:11:58.060 --> 00:12:01.390
<i>You’ll be in over your head by the time I’m done with you.</i>

00:12:01.390 --> 00:12:02.580
<i>Way over your head.</i>

00:12:02.950 --> 00:12:07.210
<i>So you’re going to punch me from a distance while I’m too tired to move?</i>

00:12:07.210 --> 00:12:09.380
<i>Damn you!</i>

00:12:09.630 --> 00:12:12.380
The champion charges and throws a huge punch!

00:12:12.380 --> 00:12:13.660
But he completely whiffs it!

00:12:13.660 --> 00:12:16.610
The challenger moves around light as a feather!

00:12:16.610 --> 00:12:20.140
<i>Dammit! Come at me! Take me on like a man!</i>

00:12:21.300 --> 00:12:22.760
The challenger’s darting around nimbly,

00:12:22.760 --> 00:12:25.630
putting a lie to the last few rounds!

00:12:25.630 --> 00:12:27.610
Imae, don’t get frustrated!

00:12:27.610 --> 00:12:29.940
All he’s doing is tiring you out!

00:12:32.440 --> 00:12:35.440
<i>Dammit. He’s too hot-blooded to hear me!</i>

00:12:35.440 --> 00:12:38.270
That Aoki is such a kidder.

00:12:38.270 --> 00:12:42.330
I don’t understand. I thought he was being pummeled just a while ago.

00:12:42.330 --> 00:12:45.350
An amateur like you might see it that way.

00:12:46.820 --> 00:12:48.580
He was playing possum.

00:12:49.330 --> 00:12:54.000
Imae continued punching thinking he had a chance, all through the past three rounds.

00:12:54.360 --> 00:12:57.010
He kept trying to break through his guard.

00:12:57.010 --> 00:13:01.250
But Aoki used that to his advantage to tire Imae out.

00:13:01.930 --> 00:13:05.390
Knowing that he’s been failing to 
connect for the last nine minutes

00:13:05.920 --> 00:13:09.390
must have exhausted him both physically and mentally.

00:13:10.170 --> 00:13:11.580
He shoots a left across the bow!

00:13:11.580 --> 00:13:13.690
Connecting directly on the champion’s face!

00:13:14.030 --> 00:13:14.940
He can do it!

00:13:14.940 --> 00:13:17.090
Now’s our turn to deliver a flurry of blows!

00:13:17.090 --> 00:13:17.860
Not yet!

00:13:18.390 --> 00:13:21.070
Aoki’s not staking everything on this round!

00:13:21.900 --> 00:13:24.400
You must give Aoki his due, Yagi-san!

00:13:24.400 --> 00:13:29.580
You have to realize that the champion’s furious attacks also wore out Aoki.

00:13:29.580 --> 00:13:35.470
He might look like he’s taken a turn for the better, but he’s keeping his distance in order to recover!

00:13:35.470 --> 00:13:38.310
So that’s why he’s not engaging in one of his slugfests?

00:13:38.310 --> 00:13:41.840
So after playing possum, he’s playing phoenix?

00:13:41.840 --> 00:13:45.170
Right now his brain is in full throttle.

00:13:45.170 --> 00:13:48.890
He's putting everything he has in this match, and I mean everything!

00:13:54.460 --> 00:13:56.630
<i>He’s throwing lefts every time I take a breather?!</i>

00:13:56.630 --> 00:13:59.530
<i>Do the words “fight like a man” mean anything to him?!</i>

00:14:01.260 --> 00:14:02.070
<i>Again he darts away!</i>

00:14:02.660 --> 00:14:05.260
<i>Aoki Masaru, you damned coward!</i>

00:14:10.670 --> 00:14:12.960
<i>Don’t get so angry.</i>

00:14:12.960 --> 00:14:16.540
<i>If anyone should get royally pissed off, it's me!</i>

00:14:16.550 --> 00:14:20.120
<i>You squashed my Frog!</i>

00:14:21.420 --> 00:14:25.300
The champion loses his footing! That must’ve hurt!

00:14:26.790 --> 00:14:28.180
There’s the bell!

00:14:28.180 --> 00:14:31.430
This time it’s the champion who’s saved by the bell!

00:14:32.930 --> 00:14:35.690
<i>That one little left made him stagger.</i>

00:14:35.690 --> 00:14:38.150
<i>He’s too tired to even maintain his footing.</i>

00:14:38.770 --> 00:14:41.770
<i>He’s finally sunk to the bottom of the marsh.</i>

00:14:41.770 --> 00:14:45.660
<i>The time is now. It’s time to end it in the next round!</i>

00:14:45.660 --> 00:14:50.180
<i>And I’ll do it by using my new secret weapon I’ve been saving!</i>

00:14:53.670 --> 00:14:55.260
<i>How could this happen?</i>

00:14:55.260 --> 00:14:58.460
<i>Imae has never once been behind on stamina.</i>

00:15:00.570 --> 00:15:01.660
Don’t look down!

00:15:01.660 --> 00:15:03.170
You’re the champion, remember?!

00:15:03.640 --> 00:15:08.060
Don’t go for the KO, just keep getting those points!

00:15:08.060 --> 00:15:09.680
R-Right.

00:15:10.170 --> 00:15:12.530
<i>But I can barely think, let alone move.</i>

00:15:13.100 --> 00:15:15.190
<i>I can’t focus on anything.</i>

00:15:15.190 --> 00:15:17.420
Yes, you did great!

00:15:17.420 --> 00:15:20.550
But you must be tired after all that, so take those deep breaths!

00:15:20.550 --> 00:15:22.570
The next round is the final showdown, isn’t it?

00:15:23.800 --> 00:15:26.250
I can tell by that grim look on your face.

00:15:26.250 --> 00:15:30.940
I don’t know what you’re trying to pull, but do it with everything you got!

00:15:30.940 --> 00:15:32.500
The belt’s right within reach!

00:15:32.500 --> 00:15:33.820
Don’t lose focus!

00:15:33.820 --> 00:15:35.780
You better concentrate!

00:15:35.780 --> 00:15:37.210
Got it!

00:15:38.340 --> 00:15:40.850
<i>You picked the right time to encourage me.</i>

00:15:40.850 --> 00:15:44.080
<i>My new secret weapon has a high risk-return ratio.</i>

00:15:44.080 --> 00:15:47.120
<i>And it’s the first time I'll be using it in a match.</i>

00:15:47.120 --> 00:15:49.200
<i>I’m not all that confident that it’ll work.</i>

00:15:49.200 --> 00:15:51.520
<i>Hell, this will be a huge gamble!</i>

00:15:51.520 --> 00:15:53.720
<i>But I’m betting all my chips.</i>

00:15:54.110 --> 00:15:56.230
<i>Pray for me, Tomiko.</i>

00:15:57.080 --> 00:15:58.300
<i>Please...</i>

00:15:58.300 --> 00:16:00.300
<i>give me strength!</i>

00:16:01.440 --> 00:16:03.720
I know that expression anywhere.

00:16:03.720 --> 00:16:05.720
That guy’s in for a final showdown.

00:16:05.720 --> 00:16:07.530
Good luck, Masaru!

00:16:07.940 --> 00:16:09.260
Round six!

00:16:11.510 --> 00:16:13.910
Don’t blink, you two.

00:16:14.810 --> 00:16:16.430
He’s about to pull something.

00:16:17.960 --> 00:16:19.260
<i>Relax.</i>

00:16:19.260 --> 00:16:22.090
<i>Believe in yourself. You can do this!</i>

00:16:22.850 --> 00:16:24.940
<i>I must get back my rhythm!</i>

00:16:25.800 --> 00:16:27.360
They stare each other down!

00:16:27.360 --> 00:16:29.800
Now, who will be the one to strike first?

00:16:29.800 --> 00:16:31.550
<i>My rhythm!</i>

00:16:31.550 --> 00:16:32.830
<i>Left!</i>

00:16:33.890 --> 00:16:35.540
The challenger charges in!

00:16:35.540 --> 00:16:36.730
They’ll be trading blows!

00:16:37.060 --> 00:16:38.730
<i>He’s taking me on now?!</i>

00:16:40.730 --> 00:16:42.730
<i>I can’t move! I can’t get away!</i>

00:16:42.730 --> 00:16:45.440
<i>Let’s do this!</i>

00:16:50.850 --> 00:16:51.920
<i>What?</i>

00:16:54.390 --> 00:16:55.660
<i>Why’s he stopping?</i>

00:17:12.430 --> 00:17:14.540
The champion is down!

00:17:14.540 --> 00:17:17.390
He got knocked down the moment we averted our eyes!

00:17:17.390 --> 00:17:21.800
The crowd looks on confused while the challenger pumps his fists!

00:17:17.560 --> 00:17:20.450
All right! I did it!

00:17:21.800 --> 00:17:23.440
Just what the heck happened here?

00:17:23.850 --> 00:17:26.490
You did it Masaru! You rock!

00:17:26.490 --> 00:17:28.570
So how did he knock him down?

00:17:28.570 --> 00:17:29.700
Shut up!

00:17:30.140 --> 00:17:33.210
<i>He made it look like he was distracted by something.</i>

00:17:33.210 --> 00:17:35.700
<i>What in God’s name did he pull?!</i>

00:17:35.700 --> 00:17:37.360
D-Did you see that?

00:17:37.360 --> 00:17:38.240
I sure did!

00:17:38.240 --> 00:17:40.210
Thank goodness we’re here in the nosebleeds.

00:17:40.730 --> 00:17:42.320
It was the Frog Punch!

00:17:42.320 --> 00:17:44.950
He got him with the same punch that was rendered useless.

00:17:44.950 --> 00:17:47.960
In any case, the whole process was amazing!

00:17:47.960 --> 00:17:50.150
<i>Yes! It went perfect!</i>

00:17:50.150 --> 00:17:52.930
<i>I only threw one punch, but I’ve never felt this spent.</i>

00:17:53.370 --> 00:17:55.180
The champion lifts his body!

00:17:55.180 --> 00:17:56.630
But he’s still in pain!

00:17:56.630 --> 00:17:58.470
Will he get up in ten?

00:17:56.950 --> 00:17:57.950
Four!

00:17:59.140 --> 00:18:03.230
I’ve rarely seen a move like that in all my years at the ringside.

00:18:03.230 --> 00:18:06.230
Imae! Get up! Stand up!

00:18:06.550 --> 00:18:09.520
<i>Wh-What the hell did he do?</i>

00:18:09.520 --> 00:18:13.120
<i>He looked away, and I looked right with him!</i>

00:18:13.120 --> 00:18:14.620
<i>After that, everything went blank!</i>

00:18:16.680 --> 00:18:17.800
He’s up!

00:18:17.800 --> 00:18:19.570
The champion’s in his fighting pose!

00:18:19.570 --> 00:18:21.380
The match isn’t over!

00:18:21.380 --> 00:18:23.900
Get him, Aoki, and his belt!

00:18:23.900 --> 00:18:25.380
You’re almost the champion!

00:18:26.510 --> 00:18:28.800
<i>Fine, I’ll just knock you down again!</i>

00:18:29.880 --> 00:18:31.750
Oh, he's clinching!

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:33.710
He grabs on to the challenger to stop him!

00:18:33.710 --> 00:18:34.890
The champion is desperate!

00:18:35.300 --> 00:18:36.430
Break it up, you two!

00:18:36.940 --> 00:18:38.930
<i>Let go of me!</i>

00:18:38.930 --> 00:18:41.930
He’s still clinching him, trying to buy some precious time!

00:18:42.600 --> 00:18:45.210
<i>Was that surprise move even possible?</i>

00:18:45.210 --> 00:18:47.150
<i>Do boxers get distracted during matches?</i>

00:18:47.150 --> 00:18:49.120
<i>Does that really happen?</i>

00:18:49.120 --> 00:18:51.540
<i>Here, in this ring, where you put your life on the line,</i>

00:18:51.540 --> 00:18:53.030
<i>you take your eyes off your opponent?</i>

00:18:53.340 --> 00:18:55.030
<i>Nobody could do that!</i>

00:18:58.950 --> 00:19:03.290
<i>I thought he was just a clown who does his stupid clown tricks, but now there’s no mistaking it.</i>

00:19:03.990 --> 00:19:05.860
<i>This man is good.</i>

00:19:05.860 --> 00:19:09.310
<i>I’ve never seen a boxer who possesses his mental strength!</i>

00:19:09.310 --> 00:19:11.300
He threads the needle and lands an uppercut!

00:19:11.300 --> 00:19:13.050
Now there’s some space between them!

00:19:13.050 --> 00:19:14.290
<i>Crap!</i>

00:19:22.140 --> 00:19:23.520
<i>N-No!</i>

00:19:25.130 --> 00:19:26.520
<i>Don’t do it!</i>

00:19:28.260 --> 00:19:29.730
<i>Gotcha!</i>

00:19:32.130 --> 00:19:33.150
<i>He’s gone.</i>

00:19:40.830 --> 00:19:42.830
He Frogs him good!

00:19:42.830 --> 00:19:46.830
This was how he knocked him down the first time!

00:19:49.540 --> 00:19:51.550
The champion is on the mat again.

00:19:51.550 --> 00:19:53.710
The Frog Punch is back in action!

00:19:53.910 --> 00:19:55.970
Hell yeah!

00:19:55.970 --> 00:19:58.030
Was that the finishing blow?!

00:19:58.030 --> 00:20:00.600
Will the belt change hands?!

00:20:00.600 --> 00:20:02.750
Masaru, you rock!

00:20:02.750 --> 00:20:06.100
<i>W-We looked away again.</i>
